{"id":"wb-3-98","name":"个园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"个园","text":"个园，位于江苏省扬州城内的东关街，园名源于“月映竹成千个字”的意象。除竹外，最富盛名者四季假山，以石垒成四季之景，徜徉间即遍历春夏秋冬。1988年列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AA%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":92116205,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92116205","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c0a22f76f26c11750d95f08f.jpg","title":"Bamb_Garden_in_Yangzhou.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bamb_Garden_in_Yangzhou.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/Bamb_Garden_in_Yangzhou.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"Ge Yuan:Bamboo Garden in Yangzhou 个园","width":320,"height":240}}